{"sections":[{"slug":"可表现范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可表现范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"可表现范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span></strong> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个可能很大的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">却能由较小的一族对象</span> $\\mathcal S\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">此时</span>, $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">可</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">为预层范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal S)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部化(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的许多结论依赖于范畴的可表现性</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随函子定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随函子定理</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以及刻画</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Giraud公理","text":"Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另一种重要的观点</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">从</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴逻辑","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴逻辑学</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的角度</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/本质代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">本质代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法–语义对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/正则基数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">正则基数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\kappa$ (<span lang=\"zh\">通常取为</span> $\\aleph_0$, <span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/紧生成范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">紧生成范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">称满足如下等价条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\kappa$-<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">余完备</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且有一族</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现对象","text":"$\\kappa$-<span lang=\"zh\">可表现对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">构成的集合</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/滤余极限","text":"$\\kappa$-<span lang=\"zh\">滤余极限</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">下生成整个范畴</span>.</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">等价于一个小范畴的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Ind范畴","text":"$\\kappa$-Ind <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为可表现范畴是指存在一个基数</span> $\\kappa$, $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\kappa$-<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">等价的定义是</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">有一个小范畴到</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span> $j\\colon \\mathcal S\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得米田扩张</span> $\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal S) \\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是预层范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal S)$ <span lang=\"zh\">关于某个小态射族</span> $W \\subset \\mathsf{Fun}([1],\\mathsf{Psh}(\\mathcal S))$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴以及保持余极限的函子构成的范畴记为</span> $\\mathsf{Pr}^{\\mathrm{L}}$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathrm{L}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的含义是这些函子是左伴随</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随函子定理","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随函子定理</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表现的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是可表现范畴</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Pr}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上有一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/对称幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对称幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> <strong>Lurie <span lang=\"zh\">张量积</span></strong>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于可表现范畴</span> $\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在万有的可表现范畴</span> $\\mathcal C\\otimes\\mathcal D$, <span lang=\"zh\">带有一个双线性</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">即保持每个分量的余极限</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal C\\times \\mathcal D \\to \\mathcal C\\otimes\\mathcal D.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴的张量积的单位是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"$\\mathsf{Ani}$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}